This product includes software developed by Maxime Mirka at LIRMM,
Université de Montpellier / CNRS, as part of the PhD thesis "Techniques
d'apprentissage pour le contrôle adaptatif multi-niveaux du calcul distribué"
(2021), and published as:

  M. Mirka et al., "Automatic Energy-Efficiency Monitoring of OpenMP
  Applications", ReCoSoC 2019.
  M. Mirka et al., "Online Learning for Dynamic Control of OpenMP Workloads",
  MOCAST 2020.

Third-party and previously-published material
---------------------------------------------

  figures/from_papers/**

    Figures as printed in the papers and in the PhD thesis, kept for
    side-by-side comparison against the rebuilt figures. These are the author's
    own figures from the author's own publications; publication in ReCoSoC and
    MOCAST involved a copyright transfer, so their reuse is governed by those
    agreements and NOT by this repository's licence. They are excluded from the
    Apache-2.0 and CC BY 4.0 grants above.

  Patched GCC libgomp

    The instrumented OpenMP runtime described in the papers is a modification of
    GNU libgomp (GPL-3.0 with the GCC Runtime Library Exception). It is NOT
    vendored here; see the repository README for how it was built.
